Description: Stub dkms for the containerised legacy baseline
 rtpengine Pre-Depends on dkms so it can build its in-kernel packet forwarder.
 The baseline stack runs rtpengine in userspace only, so this stub satisfies
 the dependency without pulling a compiler toolchain into the image.
